+        *   **Mode 2 (Null Scattering):**
+            *   Compute `sigma_n = ClampZero(sigma_maj - sigma_a - sigma_s)`.
+            *   Update `beta` and `r_u` with null scattering PDF. If `pdf == 0`, set `beta = 0`.
+            *   Return `beta && r_u`.
